## std.opus.4-5: CELT decoding. The packets are libopus 1.5.2 encodings of
## synthetic tones and clicks (made with PyAV; no licence attached). The
## expected samples, every 53rd of the interleaved int16 output, come from a
## Python model of RFC 6716 §4.3 that matches libopus within 1 LSB.
use std.audio.opus

